      "source_motion_text": "That Council provide up to $400 000 to respond to COVID-19, including working with Mike Forbes\n      on a pilot project to provide public education on COVID-19;\n\n      \n\n\n      \n\n\n      That Council establish a committee to administer the COVID-19 funding, and appoint Councillor\n      Wade, Councillor Sahlstrom, Mayor Young, CAO Darren Kiedyk and Director of Corporate Services\n      Braden Hutchins; and\n\n      That Council review COVID-19 response and funding in 2 weeks.",
